{
  "id": "ataque-de-nervios",
  "term": "ataque de nervios",
  "definition": "Ataque de nervios is a culturally specific syndrome described among Latinos, marked by a feeling of losing control, often with intense crying or shouting. It usually occurs briefly in response to a stressful event, especially involving family, and is linked with social vulnerability as well as depression and anxiety.",
